---
description: Uniform Visualiser project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `CLAUDE.md` at the repo root first. It is the source of truth for commands, layout and conventions,
and applies to Cursor as well as Claude Code.

Short version:

- Content lives in `src/data/*.json`, validated by `src/data/schema.ts`. Never hard-code badges, anchors or rules in components.
- Placement rules live in `src/lib/placement.ts` and need a test in `placement.test.ts`.
- Do not invent regulations. If a position, size or limit is not stated by a source, keep `verified: false`.
- Badge art path is `public/badges/<category>/<slug>.png`; match `docs/STYLE.md`.
- Use `assetUrl()` for files in `public/` so the app works inside Capacitor.
- Before finishing: `npm run typecheck && npm test && npm run data:validate`.
